  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique - Expansion of a Macadamia plantation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF finance, Talentos 1 BV will be able to expand the current Macadamia plantation in Mozambique. The aim of the investment is to get the macadamia orchards stable with good yields and to grow the planted surface. Moreover, this increases employment (from now 157 to 225FTE plus seasonal from 57 to 100 employees), knowledge and skills of employees and higher health on the farm and in the immediate vicinity. In addition to the investments in equipment, the plans contribute to a direct impact in employment through a growth of 83FTE excluding 43 seasonal workers. All employees will be trained in this.</narrative>
  </description>
